# Terraform State / local provider data / saved plans
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfplan
**/tfplan
**/terraform.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars
!**/terraform.tfvars.example
crash.log
crash.*.log
# Commit .terraform.lock.hcl after first successful init.

# Local credentials
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# Python / JavaScript
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
.DS_Store
